  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan asks whether Hou clan’s recent wild earth vein Immortal Gu from the Earth Trench can replace an actual earth vein for the five regional formation. Chi Qu You says he has already obtained it through a transaction with Hou clan, but using it in place of a real earth vein still needs formation modification, and he is far from success.",
        "chapters": [
          1731
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "fac_hou_clan",
          "reg_earth_earth_trench",
          "char_chi_qu_you"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tao Zhu true inheritance requires the five regional limit formation to be rooted to an earth vein. In Fang Yuan’s previous life Chi Qu You added earth vein Immortal Gu for that. At the time Fang Yuan is planning five restriction profound light qi, the Gu has not appeared yet in the present timeline.",
        "chapters": [
          1787
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "formation-substitute",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_tao_zhu_true_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Among resources from newly formed Earth Trenches, rank seven earth vein Immortal Gu is one significant harvest.",
        "chapters": [
          1808
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "With this rank seven earth path Immortal Gu he can construct the five regional limit formation. His modified version adds it together with Formation Spirit and Formation Flag so the formation can be noticed, controlled, and moved with the immortal aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          1809
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuan-obtains-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_formation_flag_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During recuperation after the fate war he raises Immortal Gu in the five regional limit formation, including this one, to rank eight.",
        "chapters": [
          2174
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "raised-later",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
